{"author":"Humanread Founder","chapters":[{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}body{background:#0b1526;color:#e8edf5;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}.field{position:absolute;inset:-40px;pointer-events:none}@keyframes twinkle{0%,100%{opacity:.1}50%{opacity:1}}.star{position:absolute;left:8%;top:6%;width:2px;height:2px;background:#fdf6d8;\n      border-radius:50%;animation:twinkle 3s ease-in-out infinite}.window{text-align:center;z-index:5;padding:2rem}.kicker{letter-spacing:.45em;font-size:.72rem;color:#9fb4cc;animation:fadeUp 1.6s ease .2s both}@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1}}h1{margin-top:1.3rem;font-size:3.1rem;letter-spacing:.16em;\n   background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fdf6d8 20%,#ffce7a);\n   -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;\n   animation:fadeUp 1.4s ease .5s both}.sub{margin-top:.9rem;font-size:.95rem;color:#b8c7da;letter-spacing:.25em;\n     animation:fadeUp 1.2s ease 1.3s both}@keyframes swing{0%,100%{transform:rotate(-5deg)}50%{transform:rotate(6deg)}}.lamp{margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:1.9rem;display:inline-block;\n      animation:fadeUp .7s ease 2s both, swing 3s ease-in-out infinite}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"field\"><i class=\"star\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"window\">\n <div class=\"kicker\">一座只收思念的燈塔</div>\n <h1>風的信使</h1>\n <div class=\"sub\">海員把寄不出的話，交給住在燈塔的人。</div>\n <span class=\"lamp\">🏮</span>\n</div>\n</body></html>","id":459,"position":1,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"風的信使（開篇）"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;height:100%}body{background:#06101f;color:#dfe8f3;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;display:flex;overflow:hidden}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:32em;margin:10vh 8% auto;}.content p{line-height:2.15;color:#c6d4e4;font-size:.98rem;letter-spacing:.06em;\n           animation:riseIn 1s ease both}@keyframes riseIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px)}to{opacity:1}}.content p:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.6s}.content p:nth-child(3){animation-delay:1.3s}.sea{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;width:100%;height:42vh}.wave{position:absolute;left:-8%;right:-8%;height:84px;\n      background-size:60% 130%;\n      border-radius:50% 50% 40% 55% / 90% 70% 110% 80%;}@keyframes driftA{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.92)}50%{transform:translateX(-7%) scaleY(1.06)}}.wave.a{bottom:-30px;background:#123a5c;\n        animation:driftA 8s ease-in-out infinite;}@keyframes driftB{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.96)}50%{transform:translateX(-5%) scaleY(1.05)}}.wave.b{bottom:-14px;height:70px;background:#0d2a44;\n        animation:driftB 10s ease-in-out infinite;}@keyframes driftC{0%,100%{transform:translateX(0) scaleY(.99);opacity:.18}50%{transform:translateX(-4%) scaleY(1.02);opacity:.3}}.wave.c{bottom:6px;height:58px;background:#fdf6d8;\n        animation:driftC 12s ease-in-out infinite;}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"content\">\n  <p>燈塔建在島的盡頭，面朝那片永遠不會安靜下來的海。</p>\n  <p>入夜之後，浪會一層層湧上岸。而住在燈塔的人說，那不是單純的浪聲——</p>\n  <p>那是很多沒有被說完的話，還在岸邊拍打著，等一個可以被聽見的方式。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sea\"><div class=\"wave c\"></div><div class=\"wave b\"></div><div class=\"wave a\"></div></div>\n</body></html>","id":460,"position":2,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"海與燈塔"},{"html":"<p>老人住在燈塔裡，誰也說不清他叫什麼名字。大家只曉得，幾十年來他都守著那盞夜夜亮起的燈。</p>\n<p>他的工作很簡單：替海員收信、寄語。</p>\n<p>每當船靠岸，總有那麼一兩個水手走下跳板，從懷裡摸出一張折得很舊的紙，塞到他乾燥的手心裡。不貼郵票，不寫地址——或者只寫一個名字，又或者連名字都沒有。</p>\n<p>「替我把它交給風。」他們說。</p>\n<p>老人點頭，從來不多問。等船開走、燈塔的光掃過海面時，他就會把那些紙一張張攤平在窗台上，讓來自陸地的風把它們帶走。</p>\n<p>他說，風認得每一句話要去的地方——就像海浪認識岸。</p>","id":461,"position":3,"source_type":"markdown","title":"守燈的人"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;min-height:100%}body{background:#101c14;color:#e4ecdf;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:31em;margin:9vh 7%;}.stage{position:fixed;inset:0}.sill{position:absolute;right:6%;top:44%;\n      width:180px;height:12px;\n      background:#8a6f46;border-radius:4px;}.paper{position:fixed;width:58px;height:76px;background:#f3ead2;border-radius:3px;\n       box-shadow:0 5px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n       transform-origin:center bottom}@keyframes leaveA{0%{transform:translate(-40vw,-10vh) rotate(-4deg);opacity:.9}\n                  20%{}100%{transform:translate(55vw,-42vh) rotate(48deg);opacity:.7}}#p1{right:14%;top:30%;animation:leaveA 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate}@keyframes leaveB{0%{transform:translate(-46vw,-6vh) rotate(6deg);opacity:.9}100%{transform:translate(40vw,-48vh) rotate(-36deg);opacity:.7}}#p2{right:20%;top:34%;animation:leaveB 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate .5s}@keyframes leaveC{0%{transform:translate(-38vw,4vh) rotate(12deg);opacity:.9}100%{transform:translate(-28vw,-40vh) rotate(-55deg);opacity:.7}}#p3{right:16%;top:26%;animation:leaveC 13s ease-in-out infinite alternate .2s}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body><div class=\"content\">\n <p>─ 第四章 ─</p>\n <p>他把那些紙張一張、兩張、三張，攤平在窗台上。</p>\n <p id=\"l1\">風從陸地深處吹過來。紙先輕輕顫了一下，像還拿不定主意；接著便一片接一片離開窗沿，飄上海面那道由月光鋪成的路。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stage\"><div class=\"sill\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p1\"> </div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p2\"> </div>\n<div class=\"paper\" id=\"p3\"> </div>\n</body></html>","id":462,"position":4,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"窗台上的紙箋"},{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-Hant\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>html{color-scheme:light}body{margin:0;padding:1rem;overflow:auto;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;color:#17201c;background:#faf8f3}*{box-sizing:border-box}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;padding:0;min-height:100%}body{background:#04070d;color:#e6ecf4;font-family:\"Noto Serif TC\",serif;\n     min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;}.content{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:31em;margin:9vh 7%;text-align:left}.content p{line-height:2.15;color:#cfd8e6;font-size:.97rem;animation:fadeIn 1s ease both}@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}.pivot{position:fixed;left:120px;bottom:150px;\n       width:34px;height:48px;z-index:3}.core{border-radius:6px;background:#fff2c8;box-shadow:\n       0 0 18px #ffce7a,0 0 46px rgba(255,206,122,.65)}.glow{position:absolute;inset:-42px -60% ;border-radius:50%;\n      background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(252,226,155,.55),rgba(10,15,30,0) 70%)}.beam{position:fixed;left:120px;bottom:150px;\n      width:460px;height:8px;z-index:2;\n      border-radius:999px;transform-origin:0 50%;\n      background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,233,163,.9),rgba(252,226,155,.18) 70%,transparent);}@keyframes sweep{from{transform:rotate(-60deg)}to{transform:rotate(300deg)}}.beam{animation:sweep 7s linear infinite}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}</style></head><body>\n\n<div class=\"pivot\">\n  <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"core\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"beam\"></div>\n<div class=\"content\">\n  <p>─ 第五章 ─</p>\n  <p>後半夜，老人的燈塔是海面上唯一醒著的光。</p>\n  <p>他沒有替任何一句話留底。他說思念一旦說出口，就該讓它走；留在手裡的心事太多，風便再也抬不動。</p>\n</div>\n\n</body></html>","id":463,"position":5,"source_type":"sandbox_html","title":"燈塔的光"},{"html":"<p>最後一章，島上來了一位年輕的女孩。她是老船長的女兒，許多年來一直在等一封由風送抵的信。</p>\n<p>「我父親說過，他有句話拜託了燈塔。」女孩站在門外說。</p>\n<p>老人看了她很久。他沒有翻什麼舊紙堆——那些寄出之後的東西都不會留下。他只是側耳，聽了一陣從海面吹上來的夜風，然後退開一步，讓那陣風把她帶進屋裡，繞了一圈，又輕柔地送出門口。</p>\n<p>「他已經說過了。」老人對她說。「有些話等得越久，越不會迷路。」</p>\n<p>女孩站在原地愣了很久。後來，她那封等了半輩子的信沒有真的出現——但她忽然覺得，那句話一直就在風裡面，只是到她學會聽的那一天，才終於被讀懂。</p>\n<p>隔天清晨，船又要離港。老人照舊站在燈塔下送行。</p>\n<p>有個年輕水手遲疑著走過來，遞給他一張折得發皺的紙：「這個……也拜託風了。」</p>\n<p>老人接過，沒有看內容。他抬眼望向他——海員們常常這樣看他，像在看一個知道答案的人。</p>\n<p>於是老人第一次開口問：「你確定讓它走？」</p>\n<p>水手沉默良久，最後笑了：「嗯。」他說。「有些心意，留在這裡太重；交給風，反而輕了。」</p>\n<p>老人把那張紙小心地收進胸前。當天夜裡，他把燈芯挑高了一格——不是為船引路，是為了那句話能多亮一段路。</p>\n<p>天亮時，風把一切捲走。海面恢復成一面乾淨的鏡子。</p>\n<p>而那座只管送出、從不回頭追問去向的燈塔，仍舊立在島的盡頭，替世上所有說不出口的話，留著一盞恆亮的燈。</p>","id":464,"position":6,"source_type":"markdown","title":"交給風的話"}],"cover_asset_hash":null,"cover_color":"#c86b4a","metadata":{"age_rating":"all","content_warnings":"","language":"zh-Hant","primary_genre":"literary","secondary_genre":null,"serial_status":"completed","tags":["實驗小說","排版敘事","CSS動畫","互動敘事","短篇小說"],"warning_level":"none"},"novel_id":11,"rights":{"authorization_at":"2026-08-06T17:48:42.081593Z","public_copy_acknowledged":true,"reader_license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0","rights_holder_confirmed":true},"slug":"novel-ec2bbd8d-c92349","summary":"一座只收『思念』的燈塔。海員把想說卻寄不出的話寫在紙上，交給住在燈塔的人；他讓風替他把每一句送到該去的地方。關於等待、漂流與那些永遠無法投遞的字。","theme":{"accent_color":"#2a6f97","drop_cap":true,"font":"serif","font_size":18,"line_height":"2.0","paragraph_spacing":"1.4","scene_break":"line","text_align":"left"},"title":"風的信使","translation":null}
